GridGlowDischarge-20220107-150923.png", "id": "622864308982945", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036683_622864312316278_1945947703567935547_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xLSBP0YlUEoQ7kNvwF3hEsQ&_nc_oc=AdrjG_f6A9d8zSEQuqADddJMh6viJVOlcqSZ8EDmpfzdS0NPaUEWHjM2t53JxaLpr8w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR1Gxy6YQ8T8G_zpB1hKD2xRPZ9E7Y0taL8SbUmkxNrow&oe=6AFC8141"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "CryoVR - Grid Glow Discharge", "keywords": [], "long_description": "CryoVR (http://www.purdue.edu/cryovr) is a suite of virtual reality training tools developed at Purdue University to familiarize users with cryoEM equipment, such as microscopes and sample preparation equipment, through a safe and accessible, virtual environment. \n\nThis module, Grid Glow Discharge, covers the procedure of glow discharge grids using a PELCO easiGlow Glow Discharge Cleaning System. \n\nCryoVR is funded by NIH (National Institute of Health), award # 1R25EY029127. The project is developed by a collaborative team of Purdue Intelligent Visualization and Interaction Laboratory (https://va.tech.purdue.edu) and the Jiang Lab (https://jiang.bio.purdue.edu). ", "short_description": "CryoVR Grid Glow Discharge Module"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://va.tech.purdue.edu/CryoVR_download_file/CryoVR_Privacy_policies.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CryoVR by Purdue University", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.purdue.edu/CryoVR/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "393222478507326"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "SIMULATION"], "h